.SH "Detailed Description"
.PP 

.PP
.nf
requests\&.cookies
~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~

Compatibility code to be able to use `http\&.cookiejar\&.CookieJar` with requests\&.

requests\&.utils imports from here, so be careful with imports\&.

.fi
.PP
 
